Package: RNAexpected
Title: Expected RNA Minimum Free Energy from GC Content and Length
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("fienx", email = "djchamp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts the minimum free energy (MFE) that RNAfold gives, on
    average, for a random RNA sequence of a given GC content and length. The
    models were fitted to 406,470 synthetic sequences (20-4000 nt, 0-100% GC)
    folded with RNAfold, and let an observed MFE be compared against what
    sequence composition alone would predict.
